<h1>UniNest Admin System Test Report</h1>
<p class='meta'><b>Scope:</b> Admin frontend, Java servlet backend, MySQL integration and failure handling<br><b>Environment:</b> NetBeans 22 | JDK 11 | Apache Tomcat 9 | MySQL 8 | Context /uninest<br><b>Prepared:</b> 12 August 2026</p>
<div class='callout'><b>How to use this report:</b> Execute each row, enter the Actual Result, mark Pass or Fail, attach the named evidence, and complete the failure fields only when a test fails. Do not claim a pass until the action and database effect have both been observed.</div>

<h2 class='first'>1. Test Result Fields</h2>
<table><tr><th>Field</th><th>What to record</th></tr>
<tr><td>Actual Result</td><td>What the interface, Tomcat log and database actually showed.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pass / Fail</td><td>Pass only when actual result matches expected result.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Failure Observed</td><td>Visible symptom, exact error text and time of failure.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Error Evidence</td><td>Screenshot filename, Tomcat log line, SQL query result or video timestamp.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Corrective Action</td><td>Configuration or code change used to resolve the failure.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Retest Result</td><td>Result after the fix, including new evidence reference.</td></tr></table>

<h2>2. Admin Frontend and Backend Test Register</h2>
<table class='small'><tr><th style='width:7%'>Test ID</th><th style='width:7%'>Layer</th><th style='width:11%'>Feature / Component</th><th style='width:16%'>Test Action</th><th style='width:17%'>Expected Result</th><th style='width:15%'>Failure Condition</th><th style='width:10%'>Actual Result</th><th style='width:5%'>P/F</th><th style='width:12%'>Evidence Ref.</th></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-FE-01</td><td>Frontend</td><td>Login</td><td>Open Admin login URL</td><td>Login form loads with email, password and submit controls</td><td>Page does not load, styling is missing, or fields overlap</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-01</td><td>Backend</td><td>LoginServlet</td><td>Submit valid active administrator credentials</td><td>Session is created, last_login is updated and Dashboard opens</td><td>Incorrect query, database unavailable, invalid role/status, or redirect fails</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-02</td><td>Backend</td><td>LoginServlet</td><td>Submit an incorrect password</td><td>Access is denied and a clear error is shown</td><td>Invalid user is authenticated or raw exception is displayed</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-03</td><td>Backend</td><td>LoginServlet</td><td>Submit empty or malformed fields</td><td>Validation prevents authentication</td><td>Blank input reaches database or produces server error</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-FE-02</td><td>Frontend</td><td>Dashboard</td><td>Open Dashboard after login</td><td>Navigation, review summary and pending table render correctly</td><td>Broken links, missing components or unauthorized access</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-FE-03</td><td>Frontend</td><td>Navigation</td><td>Open every sidebar destination</td><td>Each link opens the correct Admin page under /uninest</td><td>404 response, wrong context path or incorrect active state</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-04</td><td>Backend</td><td>AdminPageServlet</td><td>Request mapped Admin routes</td><td>Route redirects to the correct Admin HTML page</td><td>Unknown route is exposed or valid route returns 404</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-FE-04</td><td>Frontend</td><td>Listing Queue</td><td>Search and filter listing submissions</td><td>Queue updates without layout overflow</td><td>Search ignored, filter incorrect, loading state never resolves</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-05</td><td>Backend</td><td>AdminListingQueueServlet</td><td>Request queue as authenticated admin</td><td>JSON contains paginated listings and total count</td><td>401, 500, malformed JSON or incorrect pagination</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-06</td><td>Backend</td><td>AdminListingQueueServlet</td><td>Request queue without admin session</td><td>HTTP 401 is returned</td><td>Private listing data is exposed</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-FE-05</td><td>Frontend</td><td>Listing Verification</td><td>Open a listing and review details</td><td>Property, landlord, rent, location and evidence are visible</td><td>Wrong record, missing data or broken image/layout</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-07</td><td>Backend</td><td>VerifyPropertyServlet</td><td>Approve a valid pending listing</td><td>rooms approval_status becomes approved and decision is confirmed</td><td>No row updated, invalid status or database error</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-08</td><td>Backend</td><td>VerifyPropertyServlet</td><td>Decline a listing with an admin note</td><td>Status and note are saved</td><td>Reason is lost or listing remains pending</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-09</td><td>Backend</td><td>EditPropertyServlet</td><td>Submit permitted listing corrections</td><td>Selected room is updated and success is displayed</td><td>Unauthorized room is updated or invalid values are stored</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-FE-06</td><td>Frontend</td><td>Booking Requests</td><td>Open and filter booking requests</td><td>Current bookings and statuses are readable</td><td>Records missing, controls fail or table overflows</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-10</td><td>Backend</td><td>ApproveBookingServlet</td><td>Approve a pending booking</td><td>Booking status updates and student notification is created</td><td>Booking unchanged or notification missing</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-11</td><td>Backend</td><td>BookingActionServlet</td><td>Decline/cancel booking with reason</td><td>Status and cancellation reason are saved</td><td>Invalid transition accepted or reason lost</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-FE-07</td><td>Frontend</td><td>Enquiries</td><td>Open enquiries and select a status</td><td>Enquiries display and status action is available</td><td>Wrong record or unusable empty/error state</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-12</td><td>Backend</td><td>EnquiriesServlet</td><td>Update an enquiry status</td><td>inquiries.reply_status updates</td><td>Invalid status accepted or no row updated</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-FE-08</td><td>Frontend</td><td>Messages</td><td>Open messages and compose a reply</td><td>Conversation and message validation behave correctly</td><td>Composer fails, message disappears or layout breaks</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-13</td><td>Backend</td><td>SendMessageServlet</td><td>Send a valid non-empty message</td><td>Message and recipient notification are inserted</td><td>Empty message inserted, invalid recipient or database failure</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-14</td><td>Backend</td><td>MessagesServlet</td><td>Mark a message as read</td><td>is_read and read_date update</td><td>Message remains unread or another message is changed</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-FE-09</td><td>Frontend</td><td>Maintenance</td><td>Open and filter maintenance requests</td><td>Requests and resolution controls display</td><td>Missing records or status controls fail</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-15</td><td>Backend</td><td>MaintenanceServlet</td><td>Change request status and notes</td><td>maintenance_requests is updated</td><td>Invalid status, lost resolution notes or wrong row update</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-FE-10</td><td>Frontend</td><td>Records / Payments</td><td>Open activity records and a detail view</td><td>Records render and selected detail is consistent</td><td>Incorrect record, broken link or empty state misleading</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-16</td><td>Backend</td><td>PaymentsServlet</td><td>Update payment status and receipt reference</td><td>payments fields update consistently</td><td>Invalid payment state or receipt not saved</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-17</td><td>Backend</td><td>NotificationServlet</td><td>Mark one/all notifications read</td><td>Correct notification rows receive read timestamps</td><td>Wrong user records updated or action fails</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-FE-11</td><td>Frontend</td><td>Profile</td><td>Edit administrator profile fields</td><td>Form is populated, validates input and confirms save</td><td>Fields reset, invalid email accepted or feedback missing</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-18</td><td>Backend</td><td>ProfileServlet</td><td>Save valid profile changes</td><td>users record and session display values update</td><td>Duplicate/invalid data accepted or record not updated</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-FE-12</td><td>Frontend</td><td>Forgot Password</td><td>Submit registered email</td><td>Neutral confirmation is shown</td><td>Account existence is exposed or request crashes</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-19</td><td>Backend</td><td>ForgotPasswordServlet</td><td>Submit registered and unknown emails</td><td>Registered request creates notification; response remains safe</td><td>SQL error, account enumeration or no notification</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-FE-13</td><td>Frontend</td><td>Admin Access Request</td><td>Submit access request form</td><td>Required-field validation and confirmation work</td><td>Invalid submission accepted or raw backend message shown</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-20</td><td>Backend</td><td>AdminRegisterRequestServlet</td><td>Submit valid admin request</td><td>Notification is recorded for review</td><td>Request lost, duplicate mishandled or database error</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-21</td><td>Backend</td><td>DatabaseStatusServlet</td><td>Request health endpoint while MySQL runs</td><td>Endpoint reports connected status</td><td>Driver missing, credentials invalid or database unavailable</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-22</td><td>Backend</td><td>DatabaseConnection</td><td>Start Tomcat with MySQL running</td><td>Log records Database connection established</td><td>Connection timeout, access denied or unknown database</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-BE-23</td><td>Backend</td><td>LogoutServlet</td><td>Sign out from an authenticated session</td><td>Session is invalidated and login page opens</td><td>Protected session remains active</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-NF-01</td><td>Frontend</td><td>Responsive UI</td><td>Repeat core pages at mobile width</td><td>No overlap or horizontal page overflow</td><td>Controls overlap, clipped text or inaccessible navigation</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-NF-02</td><td>Security</td><td>Session protection</td><td>Open protected actions without login</td><td>Request redirects or returns 401</td><td>Admin action executes anonymously</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-NF-03</td><td>Security</td><td>SQL input handling</td><td>Submit quotes and SQL-like text in inputs</td><td>Prepared statements treat input as data</td><td>SQL error or unintended database change</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM-NF-04</td><td>Recovery</td><td>Database unavailable</td><td>Stop MySQL temporarily and repeat health/login request</td><td>Friendly failure; Tomcat remains operational</td><td>Stack trace exposed or application becomes unusable</td></tr></table>

